# Title: VeeamBackup Database Credentials Dump Via Sqlcmd.EXE
# ID: b57ba453-b384-4ab9-9f40-1038086b4e53
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2021-12-20
# Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1005
# Description: Detects dump of credentials in VeeamBackup dbo
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*SELECT*" AND process_exec="*TOP*" AND process_exec="*[VeeamBackup].[dbo].[Credentials]*")) AND (process_path="*\\sqlcmd.exe"))
